@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<style>
    .legal-wrapper {
        position: relative;
        padding: 50px 0 80px;
    }

    .legal-glow {
        position: absolute;
        width: 350px;
        height: 350px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 107, 87, 0.15) 0%, rgba(250, 247, 242, 0) 70%);
        filter: blur(50px);
        pointer-events: none;
        top: -20px;
        left: -80px;
        z-index: 0;
    }

    .legal-card {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 87, 0.15);
        border-radius: 28px;
        box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
    }

    .text-gradient-coral {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111111 20%, #FF6B57 80%);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #111111;
        margin-top: 1.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .legal-content p, .legal-content li {
        color: #555555;
        line-height: 1.7;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
        padding-left: 1.25rem;
    }
</style>

<div class="legal-wrapper">
    <div class="legal-glow"></div>

    <div class="container" style="max-width: 860px;">
        <div class="legal-card p-4 p-md-5">
            <div class="text-center mb-4 pb-3 border-bottom">
                <span class="badge rounded-pill px-3 py-2 mb-2" style="background-color: var(--bs-pill-bg); color: var(--bs-pill-text); font-weight: 700;">
                    Legal &amp; Compliance
                </span>
                <h1 class="display-5 fw-extrabold text-dark mb-2">
                    Privacy <span class="text-gradient-coral">Policy</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-muted small">Last updated: August 2026</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-content">
                <p>Welcome to <strong>Siddhartha Bank Auction Portal</strong>. We value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you register, participate in live asset auctions, or interact with our portal.</p>

                <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>To facilitate secure bidding and account verification, we collect the following personal information:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Account Data:</strong> Full name, email address, phone number, and age verification details provided during registration.</li>
                    <li><strong>Bidding Activity:</strong> Bid history, saved listings, winning bids, and transaction records.</li>
                    <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP addresses, browser types, session activity, and device identifiers collected automatically via cookies and portal diagnostics.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <p>Your information is processed strictly for the following purposes:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Verifying eligibility for active bidding on high-value banking assets.</li>
                    <li>Processing bids, declaring winning bidders, and issuing official auction notices.</li>
                    <li>Ensuring compliance with banking regulations, legal auditing, and anti-fraud protocols.</li>
                    <li>Communicating critical auction updates, account alerts, and system notices.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>3. Data Sharing &amp; Disclosure</h2>
                <p>Siddhartha Bank does not sell or lease your personal data to third-party marketers. Data may only be shared under strict legal conditions:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Authorized Staff:</strong> Internal bank officers and administrators managing asset sales.</li>
                    <li><strong>Legal &amp; Regulatory Bodies:</strong> Regulatory authorities or law enforcement agencies when mandated by applicable law.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
                <p>We implement robust administrative, technical, and physical security measures—including encrypted transmissions, strict password policies, and multi-layered access controls—to safeguard your information against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.</p>

                <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
                <p>You have the right to inspect, update, or correct your personal profile information at any time via your account settings. For inquiries regarding account closure or data retention policies, please contact bank administration.</p>

                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-top text-center">
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Have questions about our privacy practices?</p>
                    <a href="#" class="fw-semibold text-decoration-none" style="color: #FF6B57;">Contact Compliance Team &rarr;</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>